<p>Regenerates <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.14, 0.31, 0.45, 0.59, 0.71</acronym> mana per turn, and increases physical and spell critical chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 7%, 9%, 11%</acronym> while active.</p>